  "updated_at": "2026-03-19",
  "bio": "Iza Smaza is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in fine line, illustrative, and floral designs, based out of Wrocław, Poland. Clients know Iza for their exceptional attention to detail and ability to bring intricate artwork to life on the skin. As an artist at Studio Lewareka, Iza maintains a high standard of professionalism in both their craft and their interaction with clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wroclaw, Lower Silesian Voivodeship, Poland"
}